chezmoi dots pkg status — Every tool: installed, pinned and latest versions

USAGE
  chezmoi dots pkg status [options]

ARGUMENTS
  None. Default: inspect installed tools and look up latest versions without fetching git.
  Pinned archive externals are compared with their repository HEAD.
  --offline skips upstream lookups and the git fetch; brew and apt still report latest from their local index, and version commands or winget export may still reach the network.

OPTIONS
  -h, --help  Show this help and exit successfully.
  --check  exit non-zero for outdated, drifted or missing tools (default: "false")
  --fetch  git fetch the dotfiles first (default: "false")
  --offline  skip upstream lookups (releases, uv, npm) and the git fetch (default: "false")

ENVIRONMENT
  CHEZMOI_EXECUTABLE  chezmoi executable (default: chezmoi).
  CHEZMOI_CONFIG_FILE  chezmoi config file (default: chezmoi's config).
  CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR  source directory (default: ask chezmoi; honors .chezmoiroot).
  CHEZMOI_WORKING_TREE  dotfiles working tree (default: ask chezmoi).

EXAMPLES
  chezmoi dots pkg status
  chezmoi dots pkg status --offline
  chezmoi dots pkg status --fetch --check
